# --- Deployment notes ---
# /public/build is intentionally COMMITTED: Hostinger shared hosting has no
# Node/npm to run `npm run build`, so we build locally and ship the compiled
# assets. Run `npm run build` before every deploy that touches CSS/JS.

# Local SQLite dev database must never reach the server (server uses MySQL).
/database/*.sqlite
/database/*.sqlite-journal
